  m_Name: Story_introduct_08_02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "M\u1ED9t \u0111\u1EE9a tr\u1EBB kh\xE1c"
    Lines:
    - "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\xED th\u1EBF h\xF9ng h\u1ED5 c\u1EE7a \u0111\xE1m tr\u1EBB
      l\xE0ng b\xEAn, \u0110inh Ho\xE0n kh\u1EBD nh\u1EBFch m\xE9p. Thay v\xEC lao
      l\xEAn, c\u1EADu ra hi\u1EC7u cho \u0111\xE1m tr\u1EBB c\u1EE7a m\xECnh l\xF9i
      l\u1EA1i, gi\u1EA3 v\u1EDD r\u1ED1i lo\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh v\xE0 t\u1ECF
      ra y\u1EBFu th\u1EBF. \u0110inh \u0110i\u1EC1n th\u1EA5y v\u1EADy th\xEC c\xE0ng
      ki\xEAu ng\u1EA1o, th\xFAc qu\xE2n \xE0o \u1EA1t truy \u0111u\u1ED5i. Ngay
      khi \u0111\u1ED9i c\u1EE7a \u0110i\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3 l\u1ECDt s\xE2u v\xE0o
      b\xE3i c\u1ECF lau um t\xF9m ven s\xF4ng, \u0110inh Ho\xE0n b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD
      ph\xE1t ra m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng hu\xFDt s\xE1o vang tr\u1EDDi. T\u1EEB hai b\xEAn
      s\u01B0\u1EDDn, m\u1ED9t to\xE1n tr\u1EBB kh\xE1c \u0111\xE3 mai ph\u1EE5c
      s\u1EB5n b\u1ED7ng nhi\xEAn x\xF4ng ra, \u0111\xE1nh \xFAp v\xE0o s\u01B0\u1EDDn
      \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh c\u1EE7a \u0110inh \u0110i\u1EC1n, t\u1EA1o n\xEAn th\u1EBF
      g\u1ECDng k\xECm b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD."
